sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as Dialogue/Workflow UI
  participant Workspace as Cognitive Workspace
  participant Attention as Attention Router
  participant Recall as Recall Orchestrator
  participant Claims as Claim/Evidence Ledger
  participant Gate as Metamemory Gate
  participant Signals as Signal + Prediction Error Ledger
  participant Review as Review / Epistemic Drive

  User->>UI: Ask question / run step
  UI->>Workspace: Get or create active frame
  Workspace->>Attention: Current goal, focus, open questions
  Attention-->>UI: Decision: Recall
  Attention->>Recall: Recall request with workspace context
  Recall->>Claims: Load selected claims and belief states
  Recall-->>Workspace: Focus slots + inhibited candidates
  Workspace->>Gate: Evaluate answer readiness
  Gate-->>UI: Answer / warning / clarification / probe / abstain
  User->>UI: Confirm, correct, challenge, or continue
  UI->>Signals: Record observation and prediction error
  Signals->>Review: Publish evidence for review / gap / regression
